- `main.go`: `norm.Normalize(strings.Join(os.Args[1:], " "))` — today uses default behavior (lower + collapse + trim). Should use `norm.Default()`.
- `index/index.go`: `norm.Normalize(d)` — same, word splitting on normalize result. Use `norm.Default()`.
