- `norm_test.go`: TestNormalizeLowercasesAndCollapses calls `Normalize("  Hello   World  ")` expecting `"hello world"`. Need to use `norm.Default()` or equivalent.
- `norm_test.go`: TestNormalizeKeepsPunctuation calls `Normalize("Hello, World!")` expecting `"hello, world!"`. This is default behavior (no StripPunct).

A zero Options only trims. So for existing callers that want lower+collapse, they need `Default()`.

