 * Determine whether *version* satisfies *range*.
 * Supported range syntaxes:
 *   "*"            – always true
 *   bare V         – exact equality
 *   "^V"           – ≥ V and < next breaking change of leftmost non-zero field
 *   "~V"           – ≥ V and < X.(Y+1).0
 *   ">=V",">V","<=V","<V" – relational operators
